# The old `/* /index.html 200` catch-all made every URL return the homepage
# with a 200, which is a soft-404 pattern — Google can index junk URLs as
# real pages. This is a multi-page build now, so Cloudflare serves the real
# file for each route and falls through to 404.html for anything unknown.
/home              /            301
/index.html        /            301
/services.html     /services/   301
